WEBVTT

02:18:05.778 --> 02:18:08.197
Another year gone.

02:18:08.989 --> 02:18:13.535
And now, as I understand it,
the house cup needs awarding.

02:18:13.702 --> 02:18:16.371
And the points stand thus:

02:18:16.538 --> 02:18:22.377
In fourth place,
Gryffindor with 312 points.

02:18:24.338 --> 02:18:30.010
Third place,
hufflepuff with 352 points.

02:18:35.307 --> 02:18:37.059
In second place...

02:18:37.309 --> 02:18:42.064
Ravenclaw with 426 points.

02:18:47.736 --> 02:18:49.488
And in first place...

02:18:49.822 --> 02:18:55.244
With 472 points, Slytherin house.

02:19:00.833 --> 02:19:03.043
Nice one, mate.

02:19:06.880 --> 02:19:10.968
Yes, well done, Slytherin.
Well done.

02:19:11.218 --> 02:19:15.514
However, recent events must
be taken into account.

02:19:15.722 --> 02:19:20.686
And I have a few last-minute points
to award.

02:19:21.270 --> 02:19:26.775
To miss Hermione Granger,
for the cool use of intellect...

02:19:27.025 --> 02:19:29.778
While others were in grave peril...

02:19:30.529 --> 02:19:32.781
50 points.

02:19:33.699 --> 02:19:34.992
Good job.

02:19:42.708 --> 02:19:48.755
Second, to Mr. Ronald Weasley,
for the best-played game of chess...

02:19:49.256 --> 02:19:54.511
That Hogwarts has seen
these many years, 50 points.

02:20:01.727 --> 02:20:04.605
To Mr. Harry Potter...

02:20:04.813 --> 02:20:09.109
For pure nerve
and outstanding courage...

02:20:09.651 --> 02:20:14.573
I award Gryffindor house 60 points.

02:20:22.831 --> 02:20:24.791
We're tied with Slytherin!

02:20:25.000 --> 02:20:31.006
Finally, it takes a great deal of bravery
to stand up to your enemies...

02:20:31.173 --> 02:20:35.093
But a great deal more
to stand up to your friends.

02:20:35.302 --> 02:20:38.263
I award 10 points...

02:20:38.472 --> 02:20:41.683
To Neville Longbottom.

02:20:55.030 --> 02:20:58.450
Assuming that my calculations
are correct...

02:20:58.659 --> 02:21:03.205
I believe that a change
of decoration is in order.

02:21:08.210 --> 02:21:11.630
Gryffindor wins the house cup.

02:21:31.316 --> 02:21:32.901
We won!

02:21:49.668 --> 02:21:53.005
Hagrid: Come on, now.
Hurry up, you'll be late.
